This code was typed in a hex editor! (https://hexed.it, not sponsored or related)
It's not very noteable in terms of features, but for a manual program in the big 29, I'd say it's pretty sweet!
Don't mind the extra 0s padding, those were injected by the hex editor to meet FloorVM ROM loading requirements.

